   "metadata": {
    "id": "header"
   },
   "source": [
    "# DocChat — Phase 3: LoRA Fine-Tuning on Groq-Routed Refusal Data\n",
    "\n",
    "**Model:** Meta Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct  \n",
    "**Method:** QLoRA (4-bit quantization + LoRA adapters)  \n",
    "**Goal:** Teach the model to refuse out-of-document questions and ground answers in retrieved context.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Steps\n",
    "1. Install dependencies\n",
    "2. Authenticate with HuggingFace\n",
    "3. Load and prepare dataset\n",
    "4. Load model in 4-bit with LoRA adapters\n",
    "5. Train with SFTTrainer\n",
    "6. Evaluate and save adapter\n",
    "7. Test locally\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Note:** This notebook is designed for Google Colab with a T4 GPU."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "step1"
   },
   "source": [
    "## Step 1: Install Dependencies"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "install_deps"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
